95(2)New Brunswick Regulation 83-227 under the Financial Administration Act is amended

(a)
by repealing section 5.1;

(b)
by repealing section 6.01;

(c)
in subsection 7(2) by striking out “the Central Purchasing Branch of the Department of Government Services” and substituting “the Department of Transportation and Infrastructure”;

(d)
in subsection 7.3(1) by striking out “the Minister of Government Services” and substituting “the Minister of Transportation and Infrastructure”;

(e)
in Schedule A by striking out

Department of Government Services

